That's good.
You're supposed to watch him.
That's what I pay you for.

494
00:39:04,411 --> 00:39:05,929
WOMAN:
Bobby.

495
00:39:09,450 --> 00:39:12,108
 Down here.

496
00:39:12,142 --> 00:39:13,834
Maggie?

497
00:39:13,868 --> 00:39:16,077
WOMAN:
Come on down and play.

498
00:39:16,112 --> 00:39:17,424
Is that you?

499
00:39:17,458 --> 00:39:18,632
[GHOSTLY LAUGHING]

500
00:39:18,666 --> 00:39:20,116
[♪♪♪]

501
00:39:20,150 --> 00:39:23,430
Maggie! Stop playing games.WOMAN: Bobby?

502
00:39:23,464 --> 00:39:26,191
 I have something for you.

503
00:39:26,225 --> 00:39:29,470
 We'll have lots of fun, Bobby.

504
00:39:29,505 --> 00:39:32,300
WOMAN 2:
Don't come down, Bobby.

505
00:39:32,335 --> 00:39:34,233
 Stay upstairs.

506
00:39:34,268 --> 00:39:36,132
[GHOSTLY LAUGHING]

507
00:39:36,166 --> 00:39:38,203
 Don't follow her.

508
00:39:38,237 --> 00:39:39,618
[♪♪♪]

509
00:39:39,653 --> 00:39:42,794
WOMAN:
Down here, Bobby.

510
00:39:44,485 --> 00:39:47,799
WOMAN 2:
Bobby, don't come down.

511
00:39:47,833 --> 00:39:52,424
WOMAN:
Bobby. Around the corner.

512
00:39:52,459 --> 00:39:56,221
WOMAN 2: Don't come down here! WOMAN: That's it, Bobby.

513
00:39:56,255 --> 00:39:59,500
Guys, I'm gonna tell Dad!

514
00:39:59,535 --> 00:40:03,573
MAGGIE: Bobby!ARTHUR: Bobby!

515
00:40:03,608 --> 00:40:06,473
Okay, I'll find Bobby.
But I want you both out of here.

516
00:40:06,507 --> 00:40:08,060
But, Dad--
No buts!

517
00:40:08,095 --> 00:40:09,924
I want you both to wait in the
car.

518
00:40:09,959 --> 00:40:11,650
I'll be out as soon as I find
the kid.

519
00:40:11,685 --> 00:40:15,999
Why are you freaking out?Just this once, don't argue.

520
00:40:17,691 --> 00:40:19,658
What happened to the door?MAGGIE: I don't know.

521
00:40:19,693 --> 00:40:22,420
I thought there was a door.Son of a bitch!

522
00:40:22,454 --> 00:40:24,283
I can't believe this.

523
00:40:24,318 --> 00:40:27,563
I'll break it down. Step away!

524
00:40:27,597 --> 00:40:29,668
[GRUNTING]

525
00:40:33,500 --> 00:40:38,677
Quite dramatic, but you're
wasting
your time. It's all sealed up.

526
00:40:38,712 --> 00:40:41,680
Weren't you in an orange
jumpsuit?Don't.

527
00:40:41,715 --> 00:40:43,613
What do you mean,
it's all sealed up?

528
00:40:43,648 --> 00:40:46,685
What part of that code are
you having trouble cracking?

529
00:40:46,720 --> 00:40:48,687
The entire house is sealed up.

530
00:40:48,722 --> 00:40:51,379
There must be a way.I've looked.

531
00:40:51,414 --> 00:40:54,072
We'll look again,
after we find my son.
Now get up.

532
00:40:54,106 --> 00:40:57,696
That's okay. I'll wait here.Listen...

533
00:40:57,731 --> 00:40:59,905
I don't know what the
hell is going on here.

534
00:40:59,940 --> 00:41:02,805
I really don't know
who the hell you are.

535
00:41:02,839 --> 00:41:06,705
And my son is missing.
So until I get answers,

536
00:41:06,740 --> 00:41:11,572
I'm not letting you out
of my sight. Now get up!

537
00:41:11,607 --> 00:41:14,886
All right. Breathe.

538
00:41:18,268 --> 00:41:19,891
Did the lawyer split?

539
00:41:21,582 --> 00:41:24,516
[WHOOSHING AND RATTLING]

540
00:41:27,554 --> 00:41:29,901
WOMAN:
Bobby.

541
00:41:30,971 --> 00:41:32,179
[WHOOSHING]

542
00:41:32,213 --> 00:41:34,250
[GHOSTLY VOICES
WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

543
00:41:48,333 --> 00:41:49,748
[MAN SCREAMING]

544
00:41:49,783 --> 00:41:51,992
WOMAN:
Bobby.

545
00:42:33,999 --> 00:42:37,624
Come on, guys! Stop hiding!

546
00:42:44,113 --> 00:42:46,494
MAGGIE: Bobby!Come on out, pal!

547
00:42:46,529 --> 00:42:48,738
KATHY: Stop screwing around!Hey, glass-family Robinson,

548
00:42:48,773 --> 00:42:52,121
you're wasting your breath.
This is ectobar glass.

549
00:42:52,155 --> 00:42:55,607
He's not gonna hear you.
It's shatterproof and
soundproof.

550
00:42:55,642 --> 00:42:57,195
What are these?

551
00:42:57,229 --> 00:43:01,544
That's harder to explain.
They're containment spells.

552
00:43:01,579 --> 00:43:03,442
Ghosts can't cross those.

553
00:43:03,477 --> 00:43:06,273
Ghosts?
DENNIS: Yes, ghosts.

554
00:43:06,307 --> 00:43:11,450
The supernatural realm has its
own laws. For ghosts, it's
spells.

555
00:43:11,485 --> 00:43:15,696
Either written or spoken,
ghosts have to obey them.

556
00:43:15,731 --> 00:43:17,595
[♪♪♪]

557
00:43:23,393 --> 00:43:25,603
[WHOOSHING]

558
00:43:32,679 --> 00:43:33,990
[SCREAMING]

559
00:43:35,543 --> 00:43:38,443
DENNIS:
The basement is filled with
ghosts.

560
00:43:38,477 --> 00:43:40,169
In this basement?

561
00:43:40,203 --> 00:43:45,243
Yes, this basement. If it was
next door, I wouldn't give a
shit!

562
00:43:45,277 --> 00:43:48,418
[BOBBY SCREAMING]

563
00:43:48,453 --> 00:43:51,801
I can prove it.I gave a pair of those to Bobby.

564
00:43:51,836 --> 00:43:54,114
[MAN SCREAMING]

565
00:43:56,047 --> 00:43:58,912
Spectral viewers:
you can see the ghosts with
these.

566
00:43:58,946 --> 00:44:02,536
KATHY: Bobby, come on.I don't see any ghosts.

567
00:44:02,570 --> 00:44:04,400
They're locked downstairs.

568
00:44:04,434 --> 00:44:05,919
Dad!

569
00:44:05,953 --> 00:44:08,749
There's more of those spells
on the floor.

570
00:44:08,784 --> 00:44:10,682
BOBBY: Dad!
KATHY: Bobby!

571
00:44:10,717 --> 00:44:12,442
Let me see those.

572
00:44:12,477 --> 00:44:13,996
[GHOSTLY SCREAMING]

573
00:44:16,895 --> 00:44:19,657
[HIGH-PITCHED SQUEALING]

574
00:44:19,691 --> 00:44:22,970
ARTHUR:
Bobby! Come on out, pal!

575
00:44:23,005 --> 00:44:27,803
Hidden barrier spells. Why
would he need more protection?

576
00:44:27,837 --> 00:44:32,014
That's enough.
This is not helping.
Do me a favour.

577
00:44:32,048 --> 00:44:33,912
Stop the haunted-house
nonsense, okay.

578
00:44:33,947 --> 00:44:37,260
At least until we find
the kid and get out of here.

579
00:44:37,295 --> 00:44:40,436
KATHY: Bobby, come on!MAGGIE: Where could he be?

580
00:44:40,470 --> 00:44:43,163
DENNIS:
Wait, no, no, no!

581
00:44:43,197 --> 00:44:46,994
Wait, no! What are you doing?
Did I just say

582
00:44:47,029 --> 00:44:50,860
there was a petting zoo
downstairs? No!

583
00:44:50,895 --> 00:44:53,587
There are ghosts downstairs.

584
00:44:53,621 --> 00:44:57,591
Right. But you also said...

585
00:44:57,625 --> 00:45:01,733
that they're all locked up.
Right?

586
00:45:01,768 --> 00:45:05,323
No! No way--!
Wait! Wait!

587
00:45:05,357 --> 00:45:07,566
Listen...

588
00:45:07,601 --> 00:45:10,259
I'll make a deal with you.

589
00:45:10,293 --> 00:45:14,297
I'll pay you whatever Cyrus
owed you.

590
00:45:14,332 --> 00:45:15,954
If you just...

591
00:45:15,989 --> 00:45:20,752
help me find my son.

592
00:45:20,787 --> 00:45:22,512
[♪♪♪]

593
00:45:32,074 --> 00:45:35,422
Unbelievable.
Get out of my way.

594
00:45:43,671 --> 00:45:45,466
WOMAN:
Bobby.

595
00:45:45,501 --> 00:45:47,020
[WHOOSHING]

596
00:45:53,336 --> 00:45:55,304
[GHOSTLY VOICES
WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

597
00:46:01,482 --> 00:46:03,761
JEAN:
Bobby.

598
00:46:03,795 --> 00:46:08,179
 Get out of the basement.
You need to go upstairs.

599
00:46:10,975 --> 00:46:13,874
 You need to put on those
glasses.

600
00:46:13,909 --> 00:46:16,118
MAN:
Leave me alone!

601
00:46:18,465 --> 00:46:21,192
JEAN:
That's it. That's a good boy.

602
00:46:26,266 --> 00:46:27,992
 Bobby.

603
00:46:30,857 --> 00:46:32,306
 Bobby.

604
00:46:32,341 --> 00:46:35,033
 Go upstairs and find your
father.

605
00:46:35,068 --> 00:46:38,796
Mom?JEAN: Go on.

606
00:46:38,830 --> 00:46:41,591
 Go upstairs!

607
00:46:44,767 --> 00:46:47,666
 Go find Kathy.

608
00:46:47,701 --> 00:46:49,151
 Watch out.

609
00:46:51,015 --> 00:46:52,326
 Watch out! [GRUNTS]

610
00:46:52,361 --> 00:46:54,018
[BOBBY SCREAMS]KATHY: Bobby, come on!

611
00:46:54,052 --> 00:46:56,054
ARTHUR: Bobby!MAGGIE: Bobby!

612
00:46:58,091 --> 00:47:02,371
You don't have to scream,
all right? Just...

613
00:47:02,405 --> 00:47:04,097
chill.

614
00:47:18,111 --> 00:47:20,182
[♪♪♪]

615
00:47:22,253 --> 00:47:26,671
This way.
Hold on. Listen to me.

616
00:47:26,705 --> 00:47:30,709
This will take forever.
This place is just too big.

617
00:47:30,744 --> 00:47:32,297
Okay.

618
00:47:32,332 --> 00:47:36,094
Kathy and I will go this way.
You two check down there.

619
00:47:36,129 --> 00:47:39,891
No, we should stay together.It's okay.

620
00:47:39,926 --> 00:47:44,102
Go straight, turn around,
we'll meet back here in five.

621
00:47:44,137 --> 00:47:47,278
Five. Back here.
Five minutes.

622
00:47:47,312 --> 00:47:51,213
And don't touch anything.I gotta go with him?

623
00:47:53,871 --> 00:47:56,287
[RATTLING AND WHOOSHING]

624
00:47:59,738 --> 00:48:02,224
MAGGIE:
Let's go back to the ghost
thingy.

625
00:48:02,258 --> 00:48:07,056
DENNIS:
There are ghosts in the
basement.
You can look for yourself.

626
00:48:07,091 --> 00:48:08,886
I can't see any ghosts.

627
00:48:08,920 --> 00:48:14,512
What the hell? Give me those.
Let me see. Why are these open?

628
00:48:14,546 --> 00:48:17,964
I was down here before.
They weren't open.

629
00:48:19,310 --> 00:48:22,865
God! I hate it when they dothat!Do what?

630
00:48:22,900 --> 00:48:27,594
They wait till you put your face
to the glass, then give you...

631
00:48:27,628 --> 00:48:29,941
a big, fat "boo!"Aah!

632
00:48:29,976 --> 00:48:31,322
Don't do that!

633
00:48:35,947 --> 00:48:37,673
[♪♪♪]

634
00:48:37,707 --> 00:48:39,399
See it?

635
00:48:39,433 --> 00:48:41,435
It's, it's--DENNIS: A ghost!

636
00:48:41,470 --> 00:48:45,992
Just like I've been saying all
night!
Finally, a believer!

637
00:48:46,026 --> 00:48:49,409
Ghosts are always around us.
Most can't hurt us.

638
00:48:49,443 --> 00:48:53,896
Most don't want to. Ghosts here,
ghosts there, no one cares.

639
00:48:53,931 --> 00:48:56,243
There are exceptions,
like this guy.

640
00:48:56,278 --> 00:48:59,867
Those who die violently
remain tortured.

641
00:48:59,902 --> 00:49:03,354
That's all they know.What's he doing?

642
00:49:03,388 --> 00:49:07,427
I don't know. I can't see.
I don't have the glasses.

643
00:49:07,461 --> 00:49:09,429
[SCREAMS]

644
00:49:09,463 --> 00:49:12,328
I've had it with this.
It's time to go.

645
00:49:12,363 --> 00:49:15,711
Now! Please.
Don't touch me.

646
00:49:15,745 --> 00:49:17,782
MAGGIE:
Will you come on?!

647
00:49:17,816 --> 00:49:19,370
[WHOOSHING]

648
00:49:23,236 --> 00:49:26,480
MAGGIE:
Come on, ghost boy!
Move your ass!

649
00:49:26,515 --> 00:49:28,689
[♪♪♪]

650
00:49:28,724 --> 00:49:31,692
KATHY:
Dad, slow down.
We're gonna get lost.

651
00:49:38,976 --> 00:49:40,978
[HIGH-PITCHED SQUEALING]

652
00:49:50,504 --> 00:49:52,644
[BOBBY SCREAMING
ON TAPE RECORDER]

653
00:50:01,619 --> 00:50:05,243
Dad. Listen to me.

654
00:50:05,278 --> 00:50:10,524
He's gonna be okay.
We're gonna find him.

655
00:50:10,559 --> 00:50:13,251
So ready to leave this place.

656
00:50:14,287 --> 00:50:17,048
Oh, boy.What?

657
00:50:17,083 --> 00:50:20,051
The symbol of The Jackal.What's that?

658
00:50:20,086 --> 00:50:24,435
It's the Charlie Manson of
ghosts.
If he's out, screw the kid.

659
00:50:24,469 --> 00:50:26,540
We gotta get out of here.

660
00:50:26,575 --> 00:50:30,406
Maybe Rafkin was right.
Maybe there--

661
00:50:30,441 --> 00:50:32,443
Kathy!

662
00:50:32,477 --> 00:50:36,205
Think about what
you're saying.

663
00:50:36,240 --> 00:50:39,450
There's no such
thing as ghosts.

664
00:50:40,934 --> 00:50:43,454
[SCREAMING]

665
00:50:51,841 --> 00:50:54,672
Kathy!

666
00:50:54,706 --> 00:50:57,330
Kathy!

667
00:50:57,364 --> 00:51:00,022
[SCREAMING CONTINUES]

668
00:51:00,057 --> 00:51:02,093
[♪♪♪]

669
00:51:08,582 --> 00:51:13,000
What is it?! I can't see it!
Tell me where it is!

670
00:51:13,035 --> 00:51:14,864
Get off!

671
00:51:16,728 --> 00:51:18,489
Hold on! Stay with me!

672
00:51:29,603 --> 00:51:30,570
Pull!

673
00:51:30,604 --> 00:51:34,091
Who are you?Never mind! Just pull!

674
00:51:34,125 --> 00:51:35,368
[DENNIS SCREAMS]

675
00:51:35,402 --> 00:51:38,612
Shit! Don't speak.
Don't move.

676
00:51:40,166 --> 00:51:43,721
Somehow, we got behind
enemy lines.

677
00:51:48,795 --> 00:51:49,968
[GHOSTLY LAUGHING]

678
00:51:50,003 --> 00:51:51,522
[KATHY SCREAMING]

679
00:51:53,179 --> 00:51:54,697
Hurry!

680
00:51:54,732 --> 00:51:56,147
Please hurry!

681
00:51:58,149 --> 00:52:01,152
Hey, little guy. How.

682
00:52:01,187 --> 00:52:03,120
Don't tease ghosts.
Shut up.

683
00:52:03,154 --> 00:52:06,364
You shut up.
You keep pissing them off.

684
00:52:06,399 --> 00:52:09,402
Go. Go, go, go.

685
00:52:09,436 --> 00:52:11,473
[KATHY SCREAMING]

686
00:52:14,200 --> 00:52:15,649
Maggie!What?

687
00:52:17,272 --> 00:52:18,687
[SOBBING]

688
00:52:21,897 --> 00:52:24,279
Where?
I can't see without the glasses!

689
00:52:24,313 --> 00:52:28,386
I can see.
And I think you should go this
way!

690
00:52:29,663 --> 00:52:31,389
Go, go, go, go!

691
00:52:31,424 --> 00:52:34,220
[SOBBING]
Shh, shh, shh.

692
00:52:34,254 --> 00:52:36,532
It's all right. I've got you.

693
00:52:38,431 --> 00:52:42,055
Look at me.
Daddy!

694
00:52:42,089 --> 00:52:44,299
It's okay.

695
00:52:44,333 --> 00:52:45,679
It's all right.

696
00:52:54,274 --> 00:52:59,003
Who the hell are you?
And what the hell was that?!

697
00:52:59,037 --> 00:53:03,387
My name is Kalina Oretzia.
I'm a spirit reclaimer.

698
00:53:03,421 --> 00:53:06,424
What?I free trapped souls. Cyrus--

699
00:53:06,459 --> 00:53:10,083
Forget Cyrus
and trapped souls
for a second.

700
00:53:10,117 --> 00:53:12,327
What are you doing here?

701
00:53:12,361 --> 00:53:15,502
Looks to me like
I'm saving your ass.

702
00:53:17,332 --> 00:53:21,025
Oh, my God!
It's over there!

703
00:53:21,059 --> 00:53:24,442
Give him your glasses.
Come on!

704
00:53:35,246 --> 00:53:37,421
[♪♪♪]

705
00:53:38,456 --> 00:53:40,286
Oh, my God.

706
00:53:42,495 --> 00:53:44,497
Unbelievable.

707
00:53:44,531 --> 00:53:47,120
Another one of Cyrus' victims.

708
00:53:47,154 --> 00:53:51,297
I hope to God the
barrier spells hold.

709
00:53:51,331 --> 00:53:52,677
Victims?

710
00:53:52,712 --> 00:53:55,473
Cyrus liked to enslave souls.

711
00:53:55,508 --> 00:53:58,925
That's why I'm here.
I'm gonna free them.

712
00:53:58,959 --> 00:54:00,616
ARTHUR:Listen.

713
00:54:00,651 --> 00:54:04,896
I need to know how
you got in here.

714
00:54:04,931 --> 00:54:08,141
Through an opening
when the house shifted.

715
00:54:08,175 --> 00:54:12,490
Opening where?It's closed now. It won't openagain.

716
00:54:12,525 --> 00:54:15,597
Let me show you.
This is the Arcanum.

717
00:54:15,631 --> 00:54:18,116
Many died looking
for this book.

718
00:54:18,151 --> 00:54:21,499
A 15th-century astrologer,
Basileus, wrote it.

719
00:54:21,534 --> 00:54:24,951
He describes the making
of a machine

720
00:54:24,985 --> 00:54:26,953
that can see the future.

721
00:54:26,987 --> 00:54:30,301
He wrote it while
possessed by a demon.

722
00:54:30,336 --> 00:54:32,303
I can't believe Cyrus built it.

723
00:54:32,338 --> 00:54:36,169
ARTHUR:
Built what?
What are you talking about?

724
00:54:36,203 --> 00:54:37,653
KALINA:
Basileus' device.

725
00:54:37,688 --> 00:54:41,105
We're in a machine,
designed by the devil

726
00:54:41,139 --> 00:54:43,314
and powered by the dead.

727
00:54:43,349 --> 00:54:45,972
Listen to me.

728
00:54:46,006 --> 00:54:50,666
I don't give a shit
about any machine
or devil or Basileus

729
00:54:50,701 --> 00:54:55,671
or anything, except getting
my family out of here.

730
00:54:55,706 --> 00:54:59,744
I came to set the souls
in this house free.

731
00:54:59,779 --> 00:55:02,816
You want help,
you gotta help me first.

732
00:55:04,577 --> 00:55:07,234
Kathy, can you walk?

733
00:55:07,269 --> 00:55:10,445
Kathy! Kathy!
Kathy! Kathy! Oh, no!

734
00:55:10,479 --> 00:55:12,516
This can't be happening!

735
00:55:12,550 --> 00:55:15,381
We have to leave.Not without my kids.

736
00:55:15,415 --> 00:55:18,073
Try telling him that.

737
00:55:18,107 --> 00:55:20,524
[♪♪♪]

738
00:55:24,251 --> 00:55:25,667
Come on.

739
00:55:30,154 --> 00:55:31,983
[WHOOSHING AND RATTLING]

740
00:55:36,678 --> 00:55:39,094
This way. Come on, come on.

741
00:55:41,061 --> 00:55:43,374
Stairs. Let's go.

742
00:55:44,617 --> 00:55:47,033
Go, go, go.
You go, go, go.

743
00:55:48,517 --> 00:55:51,071
DENNIS:
Oh, God! Don't touch me!

744
00:55:51,106 --> 00:55:52,590
Wait! The glasses!

745
00:55:52,625 --> 00:55:54,834
You'll need these! Catch!

746
00:55:59,494 --> 00:56:00,943
[♪♪♪]

747
00:56:04,637 --> 00:56:07,364
Good job.Sorry.

748
00:56:14,647 --> 00:56:16,787
Perfect, another dead end.

749
00:56:16,821 --> 00:56:19,617
We found the stairs.
How do we get there?

750
00:56:19,652 --> 00:56:22,068
Get away.
What do we do now?

751
00:56:22,102 --> 00:56:24,035
Get away from the glass.

752
00:56:24,070 --> 00:56:26,624
Why?
Just do it.

753
00:56:26,659 --> 00:56:28,143
[♪♪♪]

754
00:56:34,529 --> 00:56:35,978
[GROWLING]

755
00:56:44,401 --> 00:56:45,816
[SCREAMING]

756
00:56:49,751 --> 00:56:51,028
Glasses.

757
00:56:54,445 --> 00:56:57,068
DENNIS: Oh![SCREAMS]

758
00:56:57,103 --> 00:56:58,656
MAGGIE:
Duck!

759
00:56:58,691 --> 00:57:00,762
What?Move! Go left!

760
00:57:00,796 --> 00:57:04,524
Do something!
We're running out of corridors!

761
00:57:04,559 --> 00:57:06,871
MAGGIE:
Duck! Go right!

762
00:57:06,906 --> 00:57:08,217
[GRUNTING]

763
00:57:09,495 --> 00:57:11,082
MAGGIE:
Get down!

764
00:57:15,362 --> 00:57:19,712
We go to the library.
It has spell protection around
it.

765
00:57:19,746 --> 00:57:22,784
Okay. Where's that from here?

766
00:57:25,511 --> 00:57:27,513
[♪♪♪]

767
00:57:40,457 --> 00:57:43,494
Can I rely on you
not to get me killed?

768
00:57:43,529 --> 00:57:46,428
I guarantee nothing.

769
00:57:46,463 --> 00:57:49,017
[KALINA GRUNTING]

770
00:57:49,051 --> 00:57:50,881
[♪♪♪]

771
00:57:58,854 --> 00:58:00,891
MAGGIE: See anything?Shh.

772
00:58:04,342 --> 00:58:06,966
MAGGIE: Anything?No.

773
00:58:08,415 --> 00:58:10,176
Come on.MAGGIE: Okay.

774
00:58:10,210 --> 00:58:13,766
DENNIS:
You know, I think they're
just downstairs.

775
00:58:16,493 --> 00:58:18,529
Nothing.

776
00:58:20,773 --> 00:58:25,812
If we get out of this alive,
I've gotta get a raise.

777
00:58:25,847 --> 00:58:27,711
That's a big "if."

778
00:58:27,745 --> 00:58:29,851
[KALINA GRUNTING]

779
00:58:31,197 --> 00:58:32,957
Give me a flare.

780
00:58:32,992 --> 00:58:34,925
Ow!

781
00:58:34,959 --> 00:58:38,929
What's wrong? Don't start
freaking out now. Come on.

782
00:58:41,172 --> 00:58:42,933
Okay.
[GRUNTING]

783
00:58:48,317 --> 00:58:50,009
What?
Shh.

784
00:58:52,770 --> 00:58:55,428
Okay. What?
Shut up!

785
00:58:55,462 --> 00:58:57,430
Give me the book.

786
00:58:57,464 --> 00:58:58,949
[♪♪♪]

787
00:59:00,398 --> 00:59:02,711
Just back up.

788
00:59:04,541 --> 00:59:06,370
Go slow.
Okay. Okay.

789
00:59:06,404 --> 00:59:09,028
Going slow.
Slow.

790
00:59:09,062 --> 00:59:11,030
Go! Go! Go!

791
00:59:11,064 --> 00:59:12,341
Fast!

792
00:59:13,688 --> 00:59:16,242
[SCREAMING]

793
00:59:16,276 --> 00:59:17,554
What?
Who the hell?

794
00:59:17,588 --> 00:59:20,384
What are you doing here?

795
00:59:20,418 --> 00:59:21,972
[RATTLING]

796
00:59:26,632 --> 00:59:28,323
Shit!

797
00:59:31,809 --> 00:59:34,467
Hey, remember me?

798
00:59:34,501 --> 00:59:36,331
[ALL SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY]

799
00:59:42,164 --> 00:59:44,097
ARTHUR:
Thanks for taking your time.

800
00:59:44,132 --> 00:59:46,755
Down the hall,
left, then right.

801
00:59:46,790 --> 00:59:48,861
Where are we going?Trust me, okay.

802
00:59:48,895 --> 00:59:50,794
Arthur?
Trust her.

803
00:59:50,828 --> 00:59:52,830
Okay, let's go!
Let's go!

804
00:59:52,865 --> 00:59:55,522
Who is she?DENNIS: I'll explain later!

805
00:59:55,557 --> 00:59:57,179
[♪♪♪]

806
00:59:57,214 --> 00:59:59,043
[TICKING]

807
01:00:07,465 --> 01:00:09,295
[WHOOSHING]

808
01:00:11,780 --> 01:00:13,817
[GHOSTLY SCREAMING]

809
01:01:02,141 --> 01:01:04,902
DENNIS: What happened to Kathy?She disappeared.

810
01:01:04,937 --> 01:01:08,354
How do you lose an entire
family in a glass house?

811
01:01:10,459 --> 01:01:11,944
[GRUNTING]

812
01:01:13,566 --> 01:01:15,085
[♪♪♪]

813
01:01:17,743 --> 01:01:20,090
ARTHUR: Aah!Arthur!

814
01:01:21,436 --> 01:01:23,231
[SCREAMING]

815
01:01:23,265 --> 01:01:24,957
DENNIS:
Kalina, the flare!

816
01:01:29,996 --> 01:01:32,033
[ALL SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY]

817
01:01:32,067 --> 01:01:34,932
DENNIS:
Get him! Go, go!
Arthur, get up!

818
01:01:34,967 --> 01:01:38,695
This is not the time
to be a girl! Run! Go!

819
01:01:38,729 --> 01:01:42,560
Stop dragging your ass!
Go, go, go!

820
01:01:42,595 --> 01:01:44,873
Go! Run!

821
01:01:44,908 --> 01:01:48,290
Now is not the time
to sit around, Arthur! Run!

822
01:01:48,325 --> 01:01:49,464
Close the door! Go!

823
01:01:54,331 --> 01:01:57,403
MAGGIE:
Arthur, are you all right?

824
01:01:57,437 --> 01:02:00,717
God, what's going on here?

825
01:02:00,751 --> 01:02:02,477
I hate this job.

826
01:02:02,511 --> 01:02:06,274
They don't like you either.
I wonder why.

827
01:02:09,035 --> 01:02:10,830
You got something to say?

828
01:02:10,865 --> 01:02:14,247
Let's start with:
This is all your fault!

829
01:02:14,282 --> 01:02:17,147
You caught them,
now we're running.

830
01:02:17,181 --> 01:02:18,873
His uncle
built the house!

831
01:02:18,907 --> 01:02:24,154
You helped him. How could you
without knowing what he was
doing?

832
01:02:27,433 --> 01:02:30,401
I had my reasons.Money, you parasite.

833
01:02:30,436 --> 01:02:34,233
You stole people's souls for
money!
That's depraved!

834
01:02:34,267 --> 01:02:37,408
If you haven't noticed,
I'm a bit of a freak!

835
01:02:37,443 --> 01:02:40,757
I go near anything dead,
I go into seizures.

836
01:02:40,791 --> 01:02:45,900
I touch somebody, and a whole
life
flashes in front of my eyes.

837
01:02:45,934 --> 01:02:51,768
So, yeah, I'm depraved. And
Cyrus
is my friend, and he accepted
me.

838
01:02:51,802 --> 01:02:54,667
He did not. You're so pathetic!

839
01:02:54,701 --> 01:02:58,326
He used you.Shut up, both of you.

840
01:02:58,360 --> 01:03:03,055
Cut him some slack.
What difference does it make?

841
01:03:03,089 --> 01:03:06,299
You didn't tell him, did you?

842
01:03:06,334 --> 01:03:11,270
Tell me what? What now?About the fourth ghost.

843
01:03:13,134 --> 01:03:18,829
No, don't do this. I didn't tell
him.He has a right to know.

844
01:03:20,106 --> 01:03:22,971
What about the fourth ghost?

845
01:03:23,006 --> 01:03:26,354
St. Luke's Hospital.
Six months ago.

846
01:03:27,665 --> 01:03:30,082
[♪♪♪]

847
01:03:35,881 --> 01:03:41,265
ARTHUR:
You're saying my wife's spirit
is trapped in this house?

848
01:03:43,889 --> 01:03:46,650
DENNIS:
I didn't know you.

849
01:03:46,684 --> 01:03:49,791
I didn't know her.
I didn't know she had a husband.

850
01:03:49,826 --> 01:03:51,620
[GRUNTING]

851
01:03:53,312 --> 01:03:57,592
Why? In God's name, why?
Tell me, why her?

852
01:03:57,626 --> 01:04:01,803
Cyrus picked them all,
including your wife.

853
01:04:01,838 --> 01:04:03,425
I've been trying to help you.

854
01:04:03,460 --> 01:04:08,085
You call this help?! She's
right!
This is all your fault!

855
01:04:08,120 --> 01:04:12,055
Son of a bitch!Arthur.

856
01:04:12,089 --> 01:04:14,885
You can save her.
And your kids too.

857
01:04:14,920 --> 01:04:18,993
Just listen to me,
and believe me.

858
01:04:19,027 --> 01:04:22,513
This house is not a house.

859
01:04:22,548 --> 01:04:24,274
It is a machine.

860
01:04:26,172 --> 01:04:30,867
It's a complete and faithful
re-creation of Basileus' design.

861
01:04:30,901 --> 01:04:34,249
There should be 12 spirits
trapped inside.

862
01:04:34,284 --> 01:04:38,115
See these?
They represent the black zodiac.

863
01:04:38,150 --> 01:04:42,361
They are ghosts Cyrus needed
to catch. The First Born Son.

864
01:04:42,395 --> 01:04:45,157
BOY:
I wanna play.

865
01:04:45,191 --> 01:04:46,952
KALINA:
The Torso.

866
01:04:46,986 --> 01:04:49,540
[SCREAMING]

867
01:04:49,575 --> 01:04:51,197
KALINA:
The Bound Woman.

868
01:04:53,751 --> 01:04:55,374
The Withered Lover.

869
01:04:56,858 --> 01:04:58,549
Jean.

870
01:04:58,584 --> 01:04:59,930
[♪♪♪]

871
01:05:04,245 --> 01:05:07,213
JEAN:
Bobby, I love you.

872
01:05:08,835 --> 01:05:11,355
KALINA:
The Torn Prince.

873
01:05:11,390 --> 01:05:12,563
[MAN SCREAMING]

874
01:05:12,598 --> 01:05:13,806
[WHOOSHING]

875
01:05:13,840 --> 01:05:15,601
The Angry Princess.

876
01:05:17,051 --> 01:05:18,569
The Pilgrimess.

877
01:05:20,226 --> 01:05:22,332
The Great Child and Dire Mother.

878
01:05:24,955 --> 01:05:26,715
The Hammer.

879
01:05:26,750 --> 01:05:28,614
[GROWLING]

880
01:05:28,648 --> 01:05:32,825
KALINA:
And here, the sign of hell's
winter, The Jackal.

881
01:05:32,859 --> 01:05:35,621
[SCREAMING]

882
01:05:35,655 --> 01:05:37,347
And The Juggernaut.

883
01:05:39,763 --> 01:05:44,975
The machine required the energy
of these spirits to bring it to
life.

884
01:05:45,010 --> 01:05:48,151
Then the spirits are released
one by one.

885
01:05:48,185 --> 01:05:53,052
The house draws them to its
centre. Each adds its energy,

886
01:05:53,087 --> 01:05:55,399
powering it up.

887
01:05:55,434 --> 01:05:59,783
Powering it up for what?To open the Ocularis Infernum.

888
01:05:59,817 --> 01:06:02,993
 Ocularis,what's that?It's Latin.

889
01:06:03,028 --> 01:06:07,964
 Ocularis...The eye of hell?

890
01:06:07,998 --> 01:06:09,551
Very good.

891
01:06:09,586 --> 01:06:13,797
I'm stuck in a glass house
with crazy white people...

892
01:06:13,831 --> 01:06:15,143
Go on.

893
01:06:15,178 --> 01:06:18,664
In hell, there's an eye
that sees everything,

894
01:06:18,698 --> 01:06:20,700
the blessed and the damned.

895
01:06:20,735 --> 01:06:25,050
If knowledge is power,
the man who controls the
Ocularis

896
01:06:25,084 --> 01:06:27,638
is the most powerful on Earth.

897
01:06:28,812 --> 01:06:32,402
Your uncle.Great.

898
01:06:32,436 --> 01:06:38,063
So how many ghosts
have been set free?

899
01:06:38,097 --> 01:06:40,341
Eleven, and the house needs 12.

900
01:06:40,375 --> 01:06:44,241
No, Damon said
something about 13.

901
01:06:44,276 --> 01:06:49,246
There are 13 ghosts.The 13th ghost is a fail-safe.

902
01:06:49,281 --> 01:06:54,182
To stop it, the house needs
a sacrifice of life, not death.

903
01:06:54,217 --> 01:06:56,564
A willing human sacrifice.

904
01:06:58,083 --> 01:07:00,050
A sacrifice of the broken heart.

905
01:07:00,085 --> 01:07:03,640
The only ghost created
out of an act of love.

906
01:07:03,674 --> 01:07:06,125
You're the 13th ghost.

907
01:07:08,265 --> 01:07:12,062
The 13th spirit stands
before the eye. As it opens

908
01:07:12,097 --> 01:07:15,169
the spirit uses
the power of life

909
01:07:15,203 --> 01:07:17,516
to short-circuit the system.

910
01:07:17,550 --> 01:07:22,038
Uses the power of life how?By leaping into the eye.

911
01:07:22,072 --> 01:07:25,662
MAGGIE:
And Arthur's supposed to take
this leap? No way.

912
01:07:25,696 --> 01:07:28,596
That's suicide.
I won't let you do it.

913
01:07:28,630 --> 01:07:32,462
Come up with something else.
That's not working.

914
01:07:32,496 --> 01:07:37,743
Love is the most powerful
energy.Meaning?

915
01:07:37,777 --> 01:07:42,472
To save your children
you'd have to trade your life.

916
01:07:46,545 --> 01:07:51,308
Let me see this.
There's gotta be a better way.

917
01:07:51,343 --> 01:07:53,172
I don't read Latin.

918
01:07:53,207 --> 01:07:56,417
Well, we can try it
the old-fashioned way.

919
01:07:56,451 --> 01:07:59,351
Nobody'll be here to brag about
it.

920
01:07:59,385 --> 01:08:03,286
We need a plan soon.
Time's running out.

921
01:08:03,320 --> 01:08:05,460
MAGGIE:
You gonna blow the place up?

922
01:08:05,495 --> 01:08:08,014
The last ghost
is about to be released.

923
01:08:08,049 --> 01:08:09,878
I know why you feel
you have to do this.

924
01:08:09,913 --> 01:08:11,363
Get away from me.

925
01:08:11,397 --> 01:08:15,850
Psychics call it a linking.
We linked. I saw everything...

926
01:08:15,884 --> 01:08:17,783
about Jean, about you.

927
01:08:17,817 --> 01:08:22,063
Shut up. I'm not gonna listen
to this from you.

928
01:08:22,098 --> 01:08:26,585
Kalina is talking about suicide.Anything to save my kids.

929
01:08:26,619 --> 01:08:31,072
It doesn't make any sense.
There must be a better way.

930
01:08:31,107 --> 01:08:36,526
What does add up here, Dennis?
How much of this makes any
sense?

931
01:08:36,560 --> 01:08:40,357
Goddamn it. Goddamn it.

932
01:08:40,392 --> 01:08:44,430
All I can think
about are my kids.

933
01:08:44,465 --> 01:08:47,537
I don't even know
if they're alive.

934
01:08:49,159 --> 01:08:52,369
Let's go out there and find out.

935
01:08:52,404 --> 01:08:56,166
While there's still time,
you and me.

936
01:08:56,201 --> 01:08:57,581
[♪♪♪]

937
01:09:06,625 --> 01:09:08,213
Kalina...

938
01:09:08,247 --> 01:09:12,148
no matter what I do,
or what happens to us,

939
01:09:12,182 --> 01:09:14,943
can you stop that machine?

940
01:09:14,978 --> 01:09:18,740
I got enough explosives to blow
us back to the 15th century.

941
01:09:20,777 --> 01:09:22,330
Okay.

942
01:09:24,194 --> 01:09:27,646
How many flares are left?One. Why?

943
01:09:27,680 --> 01:09:28,992
We're going out.

944
01:09:29,026 --> 01:09:32,996
No fucking way.
You'll get yourself killed!

945
01:09:33,030 --> 01:09:34,825
Not if we take that.

946
01:09:36,827 --> 01:09:41,591
We got 10 minutes till
the ectoplasmic shit hits the
fan.

947
01:09:43,351 --> 01:09:45,215
DENNIS:
Go, go, go.

948
01:09:47,597 --> 01:09:49,495
KALINA:
We'll go down to buy you time.

949
01:09:49,530 --> 01:09:52,878
After you, Captain America.

950
01:09:52,912 --> 01:09:54,742
[♪♪♪]

951
01:10:00,057 --> 01:10:01,887
[GRUNTS]

952
01:10:03,820 --> 01:10:07,341
MAGGIE:
Damn, I just got my nails done.

953
01:10:07,375 --> 01:10:09,481
Here, put these on.

954
01:10:09,515 --> 01:10:12,242
Come on, let's go!
Come on!

955
01:10:13,278 --> 01:10:15,280
[♪♪♪]

956
01:10:17,454 --> 01:10:19,007
[GHOSTLY VOICES
SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY]

957
01:10:22,390 --> 01:10:25,324
GHOSTLY VOICE:
Why did you leave me?

958
01:10:25,359 --> 01:10:27,637
 Why did you leave me?

959
01:10:32,849 --> 01:10:34,678
[♪♪♪]

960
01:10:46,103 --> 01:10:48,209
There's no place like home.

961
01:10:48,244 --> 01:10:51,488
There's no place like home.

962
01:10:51,523 --> 01:10:53,490
There's no place like home.

963
01:10:53,525 --> 01:10:58,495
Knock it off, Dennis.
Just keep your eyes open.

964
01:10:58,530 --> 01:11:01,291
DENNIS:
Sure hope I don't
bleed to death.

965
01:11:01,326 --> 01:11:03,707
That would suck.

966
01:11:05,951 --> 01:11:07,366
ARTHUR:Rotate.

967
01:11:15,271 --> 01:11:16,962
[GASPS]

968
01:11:16,996 --> 01:11:20,310
MAGGIE: Is that half the lawyer?Take this. Move it.

969
01:11:20,345 --> 01:11:24,349
MAGGIE:
Oh, my God.
He's definitely looked better.

970
01:11:24,383 --> 01:11:26,765
[GHOSTLY VOICES
SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY]

971
01:11:29,285 --> 01:11:30,803
[GROWLING IN DISTANCE]

972
01:11:43,022 --> 01:11:44,507
[RATTLING AND WHOOSHING]

973
01:11:55,966 --> 01:11:57,727
God. Shit!

974
01:12:00,246 --> 01:12:01,972
Girl, hurry up!

975
01:12:02,007 --> 01:12:03,836
[♪♪♪]

976
01:12:06,805 --> 01:12:08,841
[GHOSTLY VOICES
WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

977
01:12:22,821 --> 01:12:24,374
[MAN SCREAMING]

978
01:12:26,100 --> 01:12:27,757
[DENNIS SCREAMING]

979
01:12:29,552 --> 01:12:32,762
Ram him!He's swinging for the fences!

980
01:12:36,179 --> 01:12:37,698
[SCREAMING]

981
01:12:42,806 --> 01:12:45,809
Kalina! This flare
shit ain't working!

982
01:12:47,535 --> 01:12:48,985
[DENNIS AND ARTHUR
SCREAMING]

983
01:12:57,856 --> 01:12:59,133
[GRUNTING]

984
01:13:18,083 --> 01:13:20,223
[GRUNTS]

985
01:13:20,257 --> 01:13:22,398
Where is it?

986
01:13:22,432 --> 01:13:24,952
Where is it? Where is it?

987
01:13:24,986 --> 01:13:26,332
Kalina?

988
01:13:26,367 --> 01:13:30,613
Why are you so mad at me?
I did everything you asked.

989
01:13:30,647 --> 01:13:32,960
I killed Damon, stole his
spells.

990
01:13:32,994 --> 01:13:36,342
I made sure your nephew
didn't get killed!

991
01:13:36,377 --> 01:13:38,414
Kalina!

992
01:13:38,448 --> 01:13:41,693
Where are the spells?

993
01:13:46,594 --> 01:13:49,114
You're not mad at me, are you?

994
01:13:50,529 --> 01:13:53,429
Of course not.

995
01:13:53,463 --> 01:13:55,085
What is it?
Oh, shit.

996
01:13:55,120 --> 01:13:56,742
Dennis?

997
01:13:58,882 --> 01:14:00,712
[GROWLING]

998
01:14:02,748 --> 01:14:06,718
DENNIS: Only room for one.What are you doing?

999
01:14:06,752 --> 01:14:10,618
I've wanted a reason
to like myself for a long time.

1000
01:14:10,653 --> 01:14:11,999
Don't do this!

1001
01:14:12,033 --> 01:14:15,451
Hey, bro.
You ain't nothing but a bitch!

1002
01:14:15,485 --> 01:14:17,487
[SCREAMING]

1003
01:14:17,522 --> 01:14:18,902
ARTHUR:
Dennis, no!

1004
01:14:30,466 --> 01:14:31,881
[DENNIS SCREAMING]

1005
01:14:37,956 --> 01:14:39,267
Oh, my God!

1006
01:14:41,304 --> 01:14:43,858
[SCREAMING]Dennis! Dennis!

1007
01:14:58,252 --> 01:14:59,564
[GRUNTING]

1008
01:15:04,258 --> 01:15:06,260
Dennis!

1009
01:15:10,264 --> 01:15:13,025
No! No!

1010
01:15:22,863 --> 01:15:24,140
Oh!

1011
01:15:31,388 --> 01:15:33,011
What do we do now?

1012
01:15:33,045 --> 01:15:36,290
Arthur thinks he needs
to sacrifice himself.

1013
01:15:36,324 --> 01:15:39,051
He'll only do it
if they're in jeopardy.

1014
01:15:39,086 --> 01:15:42,192
Well, put them in jeopardy.What?

1015
01:15:43,400 --> 01:15:45,575
Why not?But they're kids.

1016
01:15:45,610 --> 01:15:49,821
Greatness requires sacrifice.

1017
01:15:49,855 --> 01:15:52,720
Now I have a job to do.

1018
01:15:52,755 --> 01:15:54,722
And so have you.

1019
01:15:56,413 --> 01:16:00,556
Do it. Do it!Yes.

1020
01:16:04,905 --> 01:16:08,011
And now to finish this.

1021
01:16:08,046 --> 01:16:09,634
[GHOSTLY VOICE CHANTING
IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE
ON RECORDER]

1022
01:16:41,873 --> 01:16:43,771
[CHANTING CONTINUES]

1023
01:16:45,152 --> 01:16:46,981
[SOBBING]

1024
01:16:54,644 --> 01:16:56,646
[♪♪♪]

1025
01:17:02,721 --> 01:17:05,275
Oh, my God, Jean.

1026
01:17:07,899 --> 01:17:10,142
I loved you so much.

1027
01:17:12,351 --> 01:17:14,284
I miss you.

1028
01:17:16,010 --> 01:17:18,254
Miss you.

1029
01:17:18,288 --> 01:17:21,050
I'm nothing without you.

1030
01:17:30,887 --> 01:17:34,477
No, don't. Don't go.
Don't go. Don't go.

1031
01:17:34,511 --> 01:17:36,099
Don't go...

1032
01:17:37,929 --> 01:17:39,965
[♪♪♪]

1033
01:17:49,285 --> 01:17:51,114
Fetch the book.

1034
01:18:00,606 --> 01:18:04,162
Cyrus! Cyrus!
What are you doing?

1035
01:18:04,196 --> 01:18:06,958
You just can't teach some
people.

1036
01:18:06,992 --> 01:18:10,789
I thought I told you,
greatness requires sacrifice.

1037
01:18:10,824 --> 01:18:12,860
[SCREAMING]

1038
01:18:16,588 --> 01:18:18,107
[♪♪♪]

1039
01:18:20,350 --> 01:18:21,973
BOBBY: Kathy!KATHY: Don't look.

1040
01:18:22,007 --> 01:18:24,734
I don't wanna look.

1041
01:18:26,736 --> 01:18:28,876
Kathy, I'm scared!

1042
01:18:31,810 --> 01:18:34,399
Hey, Kathy!

1043
01:18:34,433 --> 01:18:37,436
Kathy! Bobby! Hey! Kathy!

1044
01:18:39,197 --> 01:18:40,957
Daddy!Bobby!

1045
01:18:42,131 --> 01:18:44,823
BOBBY:
Dad, help!

1046
01:18:44,858 --> 01:18:46,929
[CHANTING CONTINUES]

1047
01:18:46,963 --> 01:18:49,310
[WHOOSHING AND RATTLING]

1048
01:18:49,345 --> 01:18:51,140
Oh, my...

1049
01:18:56,179 --> 01:18:59,804
Make it stop, Dad!
Make it stop!

1050
01:19:09,296 --> 01:19:11,332
[♪♪♪]

1051
01:19:13,541 --> 01:19:15,785
[THUNDER CRASHING]

1052
01:19:15,820 --> 01:19:20,548
KALINA:
This house is not a house.
It is a machine...

1053
01:19:22,067 --> 01:19:24,898
 designed by the devil

1054
01:19:24,932 --> 01:19:28,177
 and powered by the dead.

1055
01:19:31,214 --> 01:19:35,184
 There should be 12 spirits
trapped inside.

1056
01:19:37,911 --> 01:19:40,154
 They represent the black
zodiac.

1057
01:19:42,122 --> 01:19:45,504
 Each is a ghost
Cyrus needed to catch.

1058
01:19:46,989 --> 01:19:48,853
 The First Born Son. ARTHUR: One.

1059
01:19:50,855 --> 01:19:52,649
KALINA: The Torso. ARTHUR: Two.

1060
01:19:52,684 --> 01:19:54,997
KALINA: The Bound Woman. ARTHUR: Three.

1061
01:19:55,031 --> 01:19:56,826
KALINA: The Withered Lover. ARTHUR: Four.

1062
01:19:56,861 --> 01:20:00,105
KALINA:
The Torn Prince.
The Angry Princess.

1063
01:20:00,140 --> 01:20:03,695
 The Pilgrimess.
The Great Child and Dire
Mother.

1064
01:20:03,729 --> 01:20:08,113
 The Hammer, The Jackal
and The Juggernaut.

1065
01:20:08,148 --> 01:20:10,012
Twelve.

1066
01:20:16,604 --> 01:20:18,261
You're the 13th ghost.

1067
01:20:22,956 --> 01:20:25,096
If I'm the 13th...

1068
01:20:35,071 --> 01:20:36,590
[THUNDER CRASHING]

1069
01:20:40,732 --> 01:20:44,080
You son of a bitch!

1070
01:20:47,083 --> 01:20:49,983
Release my kids, you bastard!

1071
01:20:53,503 --> 01:20:59,026
Damn you! You're nothing,
Arthur! You hear? You loser!

1072
01:20:59,061 --> 01:21:02,650
I dedicated my entire life to
this.

1073
01:21:02,685 --> 01:21:04,756
Every waking moment,
for years.

1074
01:21:04,790 --> 01:21:09,105
Have you ever shown that kind
of dedication? Have you?

1075
01:21:09,140 --> 01:21:13,006
The world has no time
for little people like you.

1076
01:21:13,040 --> 01:21:16,285
It needs people who are
willing to do anything...

1077
01:21:17,251 --> 01:21:19,288
anything for greatness.

1078
01:21:23,637 --> 01:21:27,710
You don't have a choice
this time, Arthur.

1079
01:21:27,744 --> 01:21:29,574
You will make that leap.

1080
01:21:31,403 --> 01:21:34,579
The machine requires
a ghost to be created

1081
01:21:34,613 --> 01:21:37,064
out of an act of pure love.

1082
01:21:37,099 --> 01:21:42,380
That's why I chose you,
you and your pathetic family.

1083
01:21:42,414 --> 01:21:47,385
Congratulations, you get
to become the 13th ghost.

1084
01:21:47,419 --> 01:21:48,731
Get on your feet!

1085
01:21:48,765 --> 01:21:50,319
[CHOPPY WHOOSHING SOUNDS]

1086
01:21:53,425 --> 01:21:54,910
Come on!

1087
01:22:05,713 --> 01:22:07,543
[GRUNTING]

1088
01:22:33,603 --> 01:22:36,054
[CYRUS SCREAMING]

1089
01:22:50,586 --> 01:22:52,968
[BOBBY SCREAMING]

1090
01:23:00,423 --> 01:23:03,840
Trust me, Arthur. It's not over
yet.

1091
01:23:03,875 --> 01:23:06,671
You can finish this.

1092
01:23:08,052 --> 01:23:10,088
You still have the power in you.

1093
01:23:11,503 --> 01:23:13,747
It's just a matter
of how you use it.

1094
01:23:13,781 --> 01:23:16,646
Go to your kids.
They need you.

1095
01:23:18,062 --> 01:23:20,133
[♪♪♪]

1096
01:23:25,034 --> 01:23:27,623
BOBBY:
Dad! Help!

1097
01:23:27,657 --> 01:23:30,281
KATHY:
Daddy, don't! Don't do it!

1098
01:23:33,284 --> 01:23:35,320
[BOBBY AND KATHY SCREAMING]

1099
01:23:38,496 --> 01:23:41,188
Oh, fuck!

1100
01:23:41,223 --> 01:23:42,672
[GLASS SHATTERING AND
ELECTRICITY CRACKLING]

1101
01:23:46,366 --> 01:23:48,195
Dad!

1102
01:23:57,135 --> 01:23:59,103
ARTHUR:
Don't move!

1103
01:24:02,347 --> 01:24:03,762
Keep your heads down!

1104
01:24:06,489 --> 01:24:08,250
Hold on tight!

1105
01:24:33,827 --> 01:24:35,415
[♪♪♪]

1106
01:24:35,449 --> 01:24:37,417
[GHOSTLY VOICES WHISPERING
AND SCREAMING INDISTINCTLY]

1107
01:24:46,253 --> 01:24:48,290
[BOBBY COUGHING]

1108
01:24:54,261 --> 01:24:56,505
Everybody okay?

1109
01:24:59,128 --> 01:25:01,130
You okay?

1110
01:25:02,511 --> 01:25:06,860
How did you know
we'd be safe?

1111
01:25:06,894 --> 01:25:11,934
I didn't. I just wasn't
about to leave you guys.

1112
01:25:11,968 --> 01:25:14,902
I love you both so much.

1113
01:25:26,949 --> 01:25:28,433
Mom?

1114
01:25:31,333 --> 01:25:33,852
JEAN:
I love you guys.

1115
01:25:33,887 --> 01:25:35,716
[♪♪♪]

1116
01:25:39,617 --> 01:25:41,343
 I love you.

1117
01:25:42,723 --> 01:25:44,311
[♪♪♪]

1118
01:25:53,217 --> 01:25:57,911
MAGGIE:
This is it for me! I am on
the first plane back to Newark.

1119
01:25:57,945 --> 01:26:02,916
I am sorry, family,
Kathy, Bobby, ghosts.

1120
01:26:02,950 --> 01:26:04,711
I am sick of this nanny shit.

1121
01:26:04,745 --> 01:26:08,715
I've had it! This was not
in the job description. I quit!

1122
01:26:08,749 --> 01:26:10,579
[RAH DIGGA'S "MIRROR
MIRROR" PLAYING]

